    <item>
      <title>Is This The End For Slot? 🤔GW13 First Look</title>
      <description>Never dodge episodes after poor results.

Honest reflections on tough scores: Baker grinding out 36 points, Adam scraping a small green arrow thanks to Enzo and Thiago.

Transfer talk: Gabriel debate fizzles, Munoz vs Van Dijk, and Adam’s continued “curse” of breaking players.

Free Hit strategy: weighing one‑week upside vs crowd risk, with Liverpool assets central to the conversation.

Triple Captain chip: 64% of top 10k have used it, leaving big opportunities for Haaland or Bruno in upcoming fixtures.

Looking ahead: Gameweek 14 spotlight on Man United, Haaland fit again, Leeds 


