    <item>
      <title>Gabriel...IT'S TIME TO GO | GW12 Team Selection</title>
      <description>Arsenal defender Gabriel is injured, he surely has to go before 

FPL GW12 deadline!⚽ FPL IS BACK—and chaos reigns! 

Adam &amp; Baker dive into the post-international break madness: mystery injuries, snowstorms, and Scotland’s World Cup buzz 🇸🇨. Gabriel’s gone, Arsenal’s defence is a puzzle, and Liverpool’s set-piece roulette is in full swing. Who do you trust? Who do you drop? And who’s next on Adam’s cursed transfer list?🔥 

Topics include:

- Arsenal defender fallout: Timber, Calafiori, Mosquera?

- Raya vs. risk: stick or twist?

- Liverpool’s corner conundrum—Salah or Szoboszlai?

- Scotland’s wild week &amp; Footstock nostalgia

- FPL strategy: doubling down or dodging disaster



Support the Show

• Become a patron: https://patreon.com/aboveaveragefpl

• Rate &amp; review on Spotify, Apple Podcasts, or your favourite platform

• Join our Discord for 24/7 FPL banter




Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
