    <item>
      <title>Trust The Data....Until Salah Scores 😬| THE PROCESS</title>
      <description>11 gameweeks in and the season is heating up 🔥

 With AFCON looming, injuries piling up, and FIVE transfers on the horizon, Adam, Baker, and Ivan dive deep into the decisions that matter most.

🎯 Topics covered:


  Aggressive vs conservative transfer strategies

  How to navigate AFCON and fixture congestion

  The role of data visualizations in FPL

  Eye test vs analytics: where do you sit?

  Variance, luck, and why your rank might lie to you


Whether you're a stats nerd, a gut-feel manager, or somewhere in between, this episode challenges how you think about FPL strategy — and how to find that elusive edge.



💬 Join the conversation in the comments: What’s your process?



