    <item>
      <title>GW11 Team Selection ⚽ Should Adam Bench Boost?</title>
      <description>GW11, could it be time to use the Bench Boost?



Quick highlights from tonight’s stream with Adam &amp; Baker: captain debate, bench‑boost decisions, transfers and community news.



👉 Captaincy: Haaland vs Chelsea/Arsenal options (Jalpedra, Enzo, Bruno, Bowen) — high variance week.

👉 Fixtures: City vs Liverpool headline; many 1.0–1.6 xG matches make predictions tough.

👉 Chelsea &amp; Arsenal: Chelsea leads on xG; Arsenal defence hugely influential and heavily owned this week.

👉 Bench boost: Raya, Enzo, Gabriel, Saka discussed — Alderete’s fitness is decisive.

👉 Transfers: FH/Wildcard ideas (Cucurella, James, Enzo) and planning for GW13/City fixtures.

👉 Community: Mug giveaway winners announced; Patreon/Discord shoutouts.





Support the Show

