    <item>
      <title>GW11 First Look w/FPL Harry 🤲 He Shoots, He Scores!</title>
      <description>Adam and Baker are joined by Chelsea fan Harry for a spicy post-match breakdown and FPL therapy session. From Tottenham’s misery to Gabriel’s dominance, we dive into the highs, lows, and wildcard chaos of the week.

💥 Topics include:


  Chelsea vs Spurs fallout: Cucurella masterclass, Tottenham’s tactical woes

  FPL swings: Mateta, Bruno, and the midfield minefield

  Ownership dynamics: why 10–30% picks are the new battleground

  Rank volatility and chip strategy heading into the next phase


📊 Whether you’re flying or flailing, this episode’s got the banter, insight, and brutal honesty you need.



