    <item>
      <title>Baker’s FPL Strategy: Vibes, Rodon, and Regret | GW10 FIRST LOOK 👀</title>
      <description>Another chaotic FPL weekend, another therapy session 🎢. Adam and Baker dive into the highs and lows of Gameweek 9—red arrows, rogue transfers, and the Mickey van de Ven DEFCON moment that flipped ranks across the board. We unpack our scores, defend our decisions (sort of), and preview what’s ahead in Gameweek 10.

💬 Topics this week:

- DCL vs Rodon: the bittersweet bet
- Spurs WhatsApp chaos and context-free banter
- Michael Keane regret and the art of deflection
- Bruno’s blank and United’s attacking shape
- Salt &amp; pepper chips vs curry house etiquette 🍟
- Discord league shoutouts and whiskey prizes 🥃

Support the Show

