    <item>
      <title>Is Gabriel Essential? GW9 Team Selection</title>
      <description>Join Adam and Baker as they dive into the latest Fantasy Premier League (FPL) gameweek. This episode covers:



Reflections on half-term holidays and their impact on FPL planning.

Discussion of recent European football results and their FPL implications.

Chip strategy: Bench Boost, Triple Captain, Free Hit – what’s left and how to use them.

Shoutouts to supporters and details on community games like FPL Blackjack and Last Man Standing.

Deep analysis of captaincy options, projected goals, and player picks for the upcoming gameweek.

Debates on transfers, benching dilemmas, and how to maximise points.

Listener interaction and advice for making those tough FPL decisions.



Whether you’re a seasoned FPL manager or just getting started, tune in for expert insights, banter, and practical tips to help you climb the ranks!



