        <![CDATA[<p>Join Adam and Baker as they dive into the latest Fantasy Premier League (FPL) gameweek. This episode covers:</p>
<p><br></p>
<p>Reflections on half-term holidays and their impact on FPL planning.</p>
<p>Discussion of recent European football results and their FPL implications.</p>
<p>Chip strategy: Bench Boost, Triple Captain, Free Hit – what’s left and how to use them.</p>
<p>Shoutouts to supporters and details on community games like FPL Blackjack and Last Man Standing.</p>
<p>Deep analysis of captaincy options, projected goals, and player picks for the upcoming gameweek.</p>
<p>Debates on transfers, benching dilemmas, and how to maximise points.</p>
<p>Listener interaction and advice for making those tough FPL decisions.</p>
<p><br></p>
<p>Whether you’re a seasoned FPL manager or just getting started, tune in for expert insights, banter, and practical tips to help you climb the ranks!</p>
