    <item>
      <title>Bruno Captain? 🤔 GW3 Team Selection</title>
      <description>Welcome back to the Above Average FPL podcast — Gameweek 3 edition. Adam and Baker dive into the chaos of early-season injuries, dissect fixture odds, and debate captaincy choices in a week full of uncertainty.



