      <title>Salah OUT, Power 5 IN! GW1 Draft That Defies the Norm</title>
      <description>In this episode, we break down the pros and cons of leaving out Liverpool's talisman from your initial squad. From alternative captaincy options to unlocking premium flexibility, we explore whether fading Salah could be the edge you need to climb the ranks early. 📈


