    <item>
      <title>Our New FPL Drafts | Wirtz, Marmoush &amp; Bench Boost Strategy </title>
      <description>Adam and Baker dissect their latest FPL drafts, debate explosive £7m midfielders, and unpack RobT's latest goal involvement projections. The conversation spills into wild card fallback strategies, bench boost dilemmas, and how to play the chaos when everyone's chasing value. There's love for Palmer and Bruno, some regret over Solanke, and a call to arms for anyone keen to win some spicy prizes in their mini-league.



In This Episode:


  
🎯 GW1 draft breakdown: Salah, Watkins, Palmer, and risky punts



  
📊 Reviewing RobT's projections and cheap attacker value



  
🔄 Bench boost fallback strategies — could GW8 be the sweet spot?



  
🎭 Emotion vs logic: Marmoush, Wirtz, and the madness of preseason



  
🍷 Join Beat Baker and win bourbon or coasters



  
💬 Discord shoutouts, Patreon perks, and surprise guests teased




Join the conversation on Discord and support the show → patreon.com/aboveaveragefpl


Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
