    <item>
      <title>Is Gyokeres The Best Summer Signing For FPL? w/ Ted Knutson</title>
      <description>🔄 Pre-season chaos, transfer clarity, and tactical edge: Ted Knutson returns to Above Average FPL!We dive deep with Ted—TransferFlow Podcast founder and stats pioneer—as he breaks down this season’s most intriguing Premier League signings, betting angles, and FPL implications. 

