    <item>
      <title>🤯No Creators Left — Can Solanke Still Deliver in FPL?</title>
      <description>🎯 With Son and Maddison gone, Spurs face a creativity crisis — and all eyes turn to Dominic Solanke. But is he being set up to thrive... or to fail?

In this tactical deep-dive with Nathan A Clark from The Extra Inch, we unpack:

- ⚔️ Frank’s defensive-first system and its impact on Solanke’s role

- 🔄 Why service is everything for Solanke — and who can actually provide it

- 🧠 Squad structure shifts: Is Tel, Kudus, or Brennan the new creative spark?

- 📉 FPL implications: Is Solanke a bargain at 7.5M, or just a trap?

We also touch on Spurs’ defensive outlook, new metrics like DefCon, and how Frankball could shake up your Gameweek 1 team.



If you're looking for more FPL conversation with us come and join our Patreon, www.patreon.com/aboveaveragefpl 





The podcast is also available on YouTube where you can find us at www.youtube.com/aboveaveragefpl
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
