    <item>
      <title>Can You Win FPL Without Salah AND Haaland?</title>
      <description>This episode flips the FPL world on its head! 🔄



Mark (FPL General) joins Adam and Baker to debate one of the most daring strategies in Fantasy Premier League history—playing WITHOUT Salah or Haaland. With scoring changes benefiting defenders and midfield grinders, can squad depth and smart captaincy rotations outmatch the "template" teams?



🚫 Premiums, ✅ Possibilities. We discuss bonus system shifts, defensive contribution gems, alternative drafts, and the new psychology of FPL in 2025/26. Whether you're chasing top 10k or just want to enjoy the game again, this episode is a must-watch.



No Salah, No Haaland FPL League - https://t.co/ba1D3JwYE3






If you're looking for more FPL conversation with us come and join our Patreon, www.patreon.com/aboveaveragefpl 



The podcast is also available on YouTube where you can find us at www.youtube.com/aboveaveragefpl
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
