    <item>
      <title>FPL Gameweek 1 BENCH BOOST...Crazy or Genius?</title>
      <description>Thinking about using your Bench Boost chip in Gameweek 1? In this podcast, we break down the pros and cons of starting the season with a Bench Boost, including:

✅ Best fixture matchups to target
✅ Key players to include across all 15 spots
⚠️ Risks and limitations in the weeks that follow
🧠 Wildcard timing and how to recover or pivot
📊 Contextualised insights to help you decide if it’s worth it



