      <title>FPL Strategy Shaken Up: Bonus Points, Assists &amp; AFCON Transfers Revealed!</title>
      <description>In this podcast, we break down the game-changing rule updates for the 2025/26 FPL season — all officially announced on July 19th.

⚽ Major changes to how assists are awarded
🧮 A revamped Bonus Points System (BPS) that rewards different player actions
🌍 Special AFCON transfer rules to help you navigate international absences

If you're looking for more FPL conversation with us come and join our Patreon, www.patreon.com/aboveaveragefpl 



