    <item>
      <title>FPL 22/23 | GW31 Review - And On To A Free Hit...</title>
      <description>The GW is almost over and we're already looking forward to GW32 and the Free Hit. Before this week we thought we had the perfect strike force in Haaland, Watkins and Kane, but big Dom Solanke has staked his claim as the budget man to take us through to the end of the season from GW33.Our GW review as always, and if you want to see a FH video....let us know in the comments on YT!!===============================================================This podcast is supported by @CryptoBlockDan on TwitterDan is a personal friend of ours and has done very well in the crypto world, deciding to support our journey with this podcast.If you are interested in getting to know more, head over to Dan's Twitter page and check him out.#adIf you're looking for more FPL conversation with us come and join our Patreon, www.patreon.com/aboveaveragefplLook forward to seeing you all there!====================================================================Thanks again to all our new listeners, hopefully we give you some entertainment and we can keep getting you back to the pod in the future.The podcast is also available on YouTube where you can find us at Above Average
Support the show
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
