Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</itunes:summary>
      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>It's flagship pod time as we go deep again in to the FPL Bonus Points System, looking at those teams that suck bonus in, as well as those that we may need to rethink about owning.<br><br>Does a player need in game actions in order to be part of the bonus conversation or can their involvement (baseline) project them to the heights needed to get that extra point. This is particularly important in defenders/keepers as they compete for many of the same "Actions".<br><br>Pre and Post WC Analysis, there are some big movers.<br><br>===============================================================<br><br>This podcast is supported by @CryptoBlockDan on Twitter<br><br>Dan is a personal friend of ours and has done very well in the crypto world, deciding to support our journey with this podcast.<br><br>If you are interested in getting to know more, head over to Dan's Twitter page and check him out.<br><br>#ad<br><br>If you're looking for more FPL conversation with us come and join our Patreon, www.patreon.com/aboveaveragefpl<br><br>Look forward to seeing you all there!<br>====================================================================<br><br>Thanks again to all our new listeners, hopefully we give you some entertainment and we can keep getting you back to the pod in the future.<br><br>The podcast is also available on YouTube where you can find us at <a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCnaJiRMf5hju0TlaeGK5CDQ">Above Average</a></p><a href="https://www.patreon.com/aboveaveragefpl">Support the show</a><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
