    <item>
      <title>FPL 22/23 | We Need To Talk About BRUNO</title>
      <description>  We need to talk about Bruno...Double Gameweek coming up really fast, and Bruno loves a 19 pointer in a double. Can we go without him or is it hokey cokey time? We're with Fantasy Football Scout's Captaincy man Hibbo to go through some key changes to the way Utd now play as well as looking at the impact of Eriksen / Ronaldo / Casemiro on the Portugese playmaker.Additionally looking now at fixtures following the FA Cup draw, oh and the Transfer Window closed and Chelsea signed a whole new club...If you want to hear our thoughts about Triple Captain, Arsenal Mids etc then you can catch our last podcast/video with @FPLGeneral ===============================================================This podcast is supported by @CryptoBlockDan on TwitterDan is a personal friend of ours and has done very well in the crypto world, deciding to support our journey with this podcast.If you are interested in getting to know more, head over to Dan's Twitter page and check him out.#adIf you're looking for more FPL conversation with us come and join our Patreon, www.patreon.com/aboveaveragefplLook forward to seeing you all there!====================================================================Thanks again to all our new listeners, hopefully we give you some entertainment and we can keep getting you back to the pod in the future.The podcast is also available on YouTube where you can find us at Above Average 
Support the show
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
