    <item>
      <title>FPL 22/23 | Is it time to Triple Captain Marcus RASHFORD??? | w/ FPL General</title>
      <description>With plans for chips becoming more and more prevalent we look towards GW22 and potentially a triple captain chip on Marcus Rashford. But we need some help to discuss it...enter none other than  @FPLGeneral - with 3 top 500 finishes in FPL he knows his way around the second half of the season like a pro, oh and he's a Man Utd fan. Confirmation bias incoming.Double Gameweek Player in FormFPL Legend to discuss itLet's go!!===============================================================This podcast is supported by @CryptoBlockDan on TwitterDan is a personal friend of ours and has done very well in the crypto world, deciding to support our journey with this podcast.If you are interested in getting to know more, head over to Dan's Twitter page and check him out.#adIf you're looking for more FPL conversation with us come and join our Patreon, www.patreon.com/aboveaveragefplLook forward to seeing you all there!====================================================================Thanks again to all our new listeners, hopefully we give you some entertainment and we can keep getting you back to the pod in the future. The podcast is also available on YouTube where you can find us at Above Average
