    <item>
      <title>FPL 22/23 Pre GW17 | GW17 Template with @Reuser5</title>
      <description>We look at the players making up the strongest template in FPL, can we be brave enough to go against it?Alongside us is Ivan @Reuser5 on Twitter, a man who believes solely in good decision making and removes outcome bias completely. No overall rank information AT ALL.Haaland, Mitrovic, Trippier, Almiron....and even Arsenal players - are they swords or shields to our rank?===============================================================This podcast is supported by @CryptoBlockDan on TwitterDan is a personal friend of ours and has done very well in the crypto world, deciding to support our journey with this podcast.If you are interested in getting to know more, head over to Dan's Twitter page and check him out.#adJoin our mini-league!https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/uat148If you're looking for more FPL conversation with us come and join our Patreon, www.patreon.com/aboveaveragefplLook forward to seeing you all there!====================================================================Thanks again to all our new listeners, hopefully we give you some entertainment and we can keep getting you back to the pod in the future. Look out for us as we appear on Twitter Spaces throughout the week, look forward to chatting with you all there soon!The podcast is also available on YouTube where you can find us at Above Average
