    <item>
      <title>FPL 22/23 GW15 Review | Ten Past Amateur Hour w/ @lucyhighnett</title>
      <description>When will Fantasy Premier League sort out their server issues? Ten past one, amateur hour began. It took a shine off a fantastic weekend of football (for the most part).But beyond that another gameweek is in the bank and we have secured a one-day loan deal from Who Got The Assist for Lucy Highnett to help us digest the weekend and see what we are looking at maybe punting on for the final week before the WC.===================================================================This podcast is supported by @CryptoBlockDan on TwitterDan is a personal friend of ours and has done very well in the crypto world, deciding to support our journey with this podcast.If you are interested in getting to know more, head over to Dan's Twitter page and check him out.#adJoin our mini-league!https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/uat148FPL Tips"We distill all of the week’s most important #FPL talking points and send them to you in a 5 minute email. Sign-up for free to get the weekly scoop."Subscribe for FREE right here: https://t.co/N5c6PsEvWRhttps://twitter.com/_fpltips_====================================================================Thanks again to all our new listeners, hopefully we give you some entertainment and we can keep getting you back to the pod in the future. Look out for us as we appear on Twitter Spaces throughout the week, look forward to chatting with you all there soon!The podcast is also available on YouTube where you can find us at Above Average
Support the show
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
