    <item>
      <title>FPL 22/23 - The FPL General</title>
      <description>Mark "The FPL General" McGettigan joins us for a great chat about pre season, what he's thinking strategy wise how he's looking to approach the season.The word pedigree is Mark personified as he boasts (well not really he's quite humble) 3 top 500 OR finishes and he's looking to push on again this season to finish in the upper ranks once again.Loved this chat, genuinely a great guy. This was a great pod.====================================================================This podcast is supported by @CryptoBlockDan on TwitterDan is a personal friend of ours and has done very well in the crypto world, deciding to support our journey with this podcast.If you are interested in getting to know more, head over to Dan's Twitter page and check him out.#adFPL Tips"We distill all of the week’s most important #FPL talking points and send them to you in a 5 minute email. Sign-up for free to get the weekly pre-season scoop."Subscribe for FREE right here: https://t.co/N5c6PsEvWRhttps://twitter.com/_fpltips_====================================================================Thanks again to all our new listeners, hopefully we give you some entertainment and we can keep getting you back to the pod in the future. Look out for us as we appear on Twitter Spaces throughout the week, look forward to chatting with you all there soon!The podcast is also available on YouTube where you can find us at Above Average
Support the show
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
