    <item>
      <title>FPL 22/23 is Live | Initial Reaction &amp; Discussing Analytics w/ @analytic_fpl</title>
      <description>The game is live, Simon is liv-id....well maybe not that far, but when you get to the end you'll hear him say we managed to catch him on a particularly rant filled day.Makes for good content though :)What doesn't make for great content is a tech disaster, so this one is not quite up to scratch as normal (I'm on holiday, sorry...).Regardless, great chat with Simon with some very interesting conversation about the state of the game post launch, as well as how analytics can and should be used (as well as how they shouldn't).Enjoy!====================================================================This podcast is supported by @CryptoBlockDan on TwitterDan is a personal friend of ours and has done very well in the crypto world, deciding to support our journey with this podcast.If you are interested in getting to know more, head over to Dan's Twitter page and check him out.#adFPL Tips"We distill all of the week’s most important #FPL talking points and send them to you in a 5 minute email. Sign-up for free to get the weekly pre-season scoop."Subscribe for FREE right here: https://t.co/N5c6PsEvWRhttps://twitter.com/_fpltips_====================================================================Thanks again to all our new listeners, hopefully we give you some entertainment and we can keep getting you back to the pod in the future. Look out for us as we appear on Twitter Spaces throughout the week, look forward to chatting with you all there soon!The podcast is also available on YouTube where you can find us at Above Average#
Support the show
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
