    <item>
      <title>Season 3 - Ready For The Launch? - w/@Reuser5</title>
      <description>Season 3 baby, let's go!If you take anything from this podcast, you need to follow Ivan @Reuser5 on Twitter.It was an enlightening podcast as Ivan talked to us how he hasn't checked his rank for 3 seasons until GW38, for context he has recorded finishes of 170k, 28k and 12k in those three seasons. Trusting his ability to make the right decisions each week and not focusing on outcome.It's a great listen.We also go on to talk opening fixtures, captain options etc with the information or assumptions we are making on pricing and positions.Enjoy!====================================================================This podcast is supported by @CryptoBlockDan on TwitterDan is a personal friend of ours and has done very well in the crypto world, deciding to support our journey with this podcast.If you are interested in getting to know more, head over to Dan's Twitter page and check him out.#ad====================================================================Thanks again to all our new listeners, hopefully we give you some entertainment and we can keep getting you back to the pod in the future. Look out for us as we appear on Twitter Spaces throughout the week, look forward to chatting with you all there soon!The podcast is also available on YouTube where you can find us at Above Average
Support the show
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
