    <item>
      <title>FPL Strategy: Finishing Strong GW31-GW38</title>
      <description>We look at how best to finish strong with a focus on the big 6 teams and those with upcoming interesting doubles. Navigating the final GW's of the season can make the difference between dreaming or achieving that target rank finish, or winning that mini league!!We look at just how good the good teams are, and how bad the bad have through primarily xG and xGC data as well as referencing back to actual goals and clean sheets. How the top teams have managed rotation in the past as a guide to how they may approach this season.It's a good deep dive that answers the right questions, and not just the easy spoon fed answers some people want to hear.Hope you're all having a good break from FPL this week, this should get you back in the mood as we head in to GW31.====================================================================This podcast is supported by @CryptoBlockDan on TwitterDan is a personal friend of ours and has done very well in the crypto world, deciding to support our journey with this podcast.If you are interested in getting to know more, head over to Dan's Twitter page and check him out.#ad====================================================================Thanks again to all our new listeners, hopefully we give you some entertainment and we can keep getting you back to the pod in the future. Look out for us as we appear on Twitter Spaces throughout the week, look forward to chatting with you all there soon!The podcast is also available on YouTube where you can find us at Above Average
Support the show
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
