    <item>
      <title>FPL GW28 - Polarising Gameweeks</title>
      <description>It's not often we have such polarising differences between good GW's and bad GW's but we were certainly (or at least so far) hit with one this week.Giving you the gameweek review from both ends of the scale and reminding ourselves that we are completely unable to influence anything once the deadline has passed.Baker hovering on the edge of the top 1k and should jump in there by the end of the GW all things being equal, Adam on the other hand hoping for no more pain...Another good Sunday evening chat, briefly interrupted by dinner orders but otherwise our normal chinwag with beers and whisky, a delight.====================================================================This podcast is supported by @CryptoBlockDan on TwitterDan is a personal friend of ours and has done very well in the crypto world, deciding to support our journey with this podcast.If you are interested in getting to know more, head over to Dan's Twitter page and check him out.#ad====================================================================Thanks again to all our new listeners, hopefully we give you some entertainment and we can keep getting you back to the pod in the future. Look out for us as we appear on Twitter Spaces throughout the week, look forward to chatting with you all there soon!The podcast is also available on YouTube where you can find us at Above Average
Support the show
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
