      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>Back to just the two of us this week as we discuss the ups and downs of GW25 so far.<br><br>Is the football just rubbish when it rains?<br><br>Strong performances from Lampard's Everton. Is Gordon a good cheap option? How does he compare with Ramsey up against a resurgent Newcastle.<br><br>Have Liverpool (and in particular Trent) changed the way they are attacking?<br><br>Every game covered (pretty much) and an outlook on 26 as we move in to TC Salah territory... or do we?<br><br>====================================================================<br><br>This podcast is supported by @CryptoBlockDan on Twitter<br><br>Dan is a personal friend of ours and has done very well in the crypto world, deciding to support our journey with this podcast.<br><br>If you are interested in getting to know more, head over to Dan's Twitter page and check him out.<br><br>#ad<br><br>====================================================================<br><br>Thanks again to all our new listeners, hopefully we give you some entertainment and we can keep getting you back to the pod in the future. Look out for us as we appear on Twitter Spaces throughout the week, look forward to chatting with you all there soon!<br><br>The podcast is also available on YouTube where you can find us at <a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCnaJiRMf5hju0TlaeGK5CDQ">Above Average</a></p><a href="https://www.patreon.com/aboveaveragefpl">Support the show</a><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
      </content:encoded>
