    <item>
      <title>What Can We Take From The BPS?</title>
      <description>Join us as we discuss Fantasy Premier League covering the Bonus Points System or BPS.A little different to normal but we take a deep dive in to how the bonus points are calculated and which players / teams / matchups have worked so far this season, what this means and how we can learn from the data.Highly recommend you pick this one up on YouTube.====================================================================Time stampsTBC====================================================================Thanks again to all our new listeners, hopefully we give you some entertainment and we can keep getting you back to the pod in the future. Look out for us as we appear on Twitter Spaces throughout the week, look forward to chatting with you all there soon!The podcast is also available on YouTube where you can find us at Above Average
