    <item>
      <title>GW20 - Variance / Fantasy Premier League / FPL 21-22</title>
      <description>Join us as we discuss Fantasy Premier League covering Gameweek 20 and the variance between the Salah sellers and the GW19 free hitters.Madness.We don't so much cover the games this week but go in to a bit of detail on fixture planning as well as looking at some decision making analysis and some outcome analysis to see how we are getting on this season.Good luck for GW21! Hopefully we get news on the Double GW's soon.Make sure you check out fploptimized.com for the fantastic statistical analysis used as well as get your alerts on @BenCrellin on Twitter. Thank us later!====================================================================Time stampsWon't be any this week.====================================================================Thanks again to all our new listeners, hopefully we give you some entertainment and we can keep getting you back to the pod in the future. Look out for us as we appear on Twitter Spaces throughout the week, look forward to chatting with you all there soon!The podcast is also available on YouTube where you can find us at Above Average
Support the show
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
