    <item>
      <title>GW13 - A Whole Jota Snow... / Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <description>Join us as we discuss Fantasy Premier League covering Gameweek 13. It's a quick turnaround before GW14 kicks off on Tuesday evening!Chaos on Sunday with snow postponement and general madness across the rest of the games.We had some questions around rotation and bench cover as well as going through our usual review of the games.Next pod will be LIVE on Spaces at 8.30pm UK on Thursday during the Man Utd v Arsenal game (although we'll be watching Spurs of course first...). Come and join us!We rebranded the pod name, shortly will be a new graphic redesign aligning us closely with our love of FPL and Tottenham.Time stamps Intro and our weeks9mins how deep is your bench? Strategy over the next few weeks17mins Jota22mins Arsenal v Newcastle27mins Palace v Villa. Palace set piece issues33mins Liverpool v Southampton. Oh Ralph.40mins Norwich v Wolves42mins Brighton v Leeds44mins Brentford v Everton 49mins Leicester v Watford. Should we get Watford strikers?58mins City v West Ham. Gundo and somehow we shoehorned in Chris Wood. Cancelo rest?1hr 5 Chelsea v United. Sanchoooo ?====================================================================Thanks again to all our new listeners, hopefully we give you some entertainment and we can keep getting you back to the pod in the future. Look out for us as we appear on Twitter Spaces throughout the week, look forward to chatting with you all there soon!The podcast is also available on YouTube where you can find us at Above Average FPL - YouTube====================================================================Hope you enjoy the podcast whether you are a new listener or a returning listener, if you haven't yet subscribed please do so.All our podcasts are on Apple and Spotify, you can find them all at (jatafpl.carrd.co)
Support the show
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
