    <item>
      <title>GW12 - I Like Wing Backs and I Cannot Lie / Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <description>Join us as we discuss Fantasy Premier League covering Gameweek 12 in all its glory.The main talking point is surrounding the impact of the wing backs in the game and what it means for the short/medium term with our teams.We also cover the games as usual so hopefully you get some good insight from us on that.NUMBER ONEWe topped (technically) the charts last week for UK Fantasy Sports Podcasts on Apple Podcasts, an amazing chat with Gianni and I hope that we can retain many of you for our weekly run through of the gameweek. We will also strive to get guests on periodically to mix up the points of view and content. Thank you to everyone that listened last week.We also passed 10,000 downloads - just massive, we really can't thank you all enough.====================================================================Timestamps:Intro and our weeks10mins - is the super cold a thing? 13mins - The top 3 vs the rest, is it mandatory to have all 4 premium wing backs? Can we cap them over Salah?33mins - pod league35mins - leics v chelsea38mins the new managers (Norwich, Villa, Newcastle) and their games48mins - Burnley v palace (cornet or gallagher)53mins - Watford v united 1hr - should we divorce Antonio? Can we keep the dog?1hr 5 - Liverpool v Arsenal1hr 8 - City v Everton (do we need to talk about Foden and Bernardo)1hr 12 - Tottenham v Leeds====================================================================Thanks again to all our new listeners, hopefully we give you some entertainment and we can keep getting you back to the pod in the future. Look out for us as we appear on Twitter Spaces throughout the week, look forward to chatting with you all there soon!The podcast is also available on YouTube where you can find us at Above Average FPL - YouTube====================================================================Hope you enjoy the podcast whether you are a new listener or a returning listener, if you haven't yet subscribed please do so.All our podcasts are on Apple and Spotify, you can find them all at (jatafpl.carrd.co)
Support the show
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
