    <item>
      <title>GW11 - Strikers Suffering / Fantasy Premier League 2021/22 / FPL</title>
      <description>Join us as we discuss Fantasy Premier League (FPL) GW11 Hot Topic this week mainly revolved around strikers and whether they are really earning their keep right now, how do we structure our game post IB?Conte in (with a little Italian flavour to the introduction) and what that means for Spurs is talked through when we cover the Spurs game.We also run through the games as normal though Baker had to carry the analysis a lot more than he normally does (which is a decent chunk anyway...)We have a special mid IB podcast coming up which we will announce on social media in the next few days.Thanks again to all our new listeners, hopefully we give you some entertainment and we can keep getting you back to the pod in the future. Look out for us as we appear on Twitter Spaces throughout the week, look forward to chatting with you all there soon!Intro and our weeks11mins what do we do with strikers?23mins Southampton v Villa29mins United v City33mins Norwich v Brentford39mins Chelsea v Burnley46mins Segway into get all the attacking full backs51mins Palace v Wolves53mins Brighton v Newcastle57mins arsenal v Watford1hr Leeds v Leicester1hr 3 Tottenham (didn’t really bother with Everton)1hr 15 Perma Captaincy, when does it end?====================================================================Hope you enjoy the podcast whether you are a new listener or a returning listener, if you haven't yet subscribed please do so.Enjoy the 2 week break!All our podcasts are on Apple and Spotify, you can find them all at (jatafpl.carrd.co)
Support the show
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
