    <item>
      <title>GW10 - It Wasn't That Bad Really / Fantasy Premier League 2021/22 / FPL</title>
      <description>Join us as we discuss Fantasy Premier League (FPL) GW10 with basically 100% of meaningful managers captaining Salah. And it gave us a Gameweek that really depended on whether you owned Reece James or not.We've gone through a small rebrand from Just Above The Average to Above Average FPL and I hope that you agree it's much cleaner and punchy. We like it anyway.Hot Topics this week include what to do with City defence and do we just get Chelsea full backs in and be done with it? Who are our budget enablers with the Bees (not Brentord) as in Brighton and Burnley potentially offering us routes to cash for a second premium. Is CR7 back in our thoughts, are Spurs firmly in the bin? Nuno out may change that dramatically.What we can say is things are likely to change over the next few weeks so be ready for that.As always we discuss the games one by one to give our view on what happened and what we can take for the upcoming fixtures.Thanks again to all our new listeners, hopefully we give you some entertainment and we can keep getting you back to the pod in the future. Look out for us as we appear on Twitter Spaces throughout the week, look forward to chatting with you all there soon!Timestamps:Intro and our weeks11mins Leicester v Arsenal (Ramsdale, ESR, Vardy)21mins City v Palace (what do we do with MCI def?)30mins Chelsea v Newcastle (double up? Hit them in?)39mins Burnley v Brentford (Wood, Cornet, Burnley Full Backs and do we get Brentford in?)47mins Liverpool v Brighton (Trossard)51mins Watford v Southampton (Adams and Armstrong)55mins Who do we bench in GW11? Cancelo/Livra/Antonio?57mins Tottenham v United (nuno out, what do we do with Spurs, back to Ronaldo?)1hr7 Norwich v Leeds (Raphinha)1hr10 Villa v West Ham (Bowen, Rice, West Ham are good)1hr20 a little something something if you listen this far 🎁====================================================================Hope you enjoy the podcast whether you are a new listener or a returning listener, if you haven't yet subscribed please do so.Good luck for GW11!All our podcasts are on Apple and Spotify, you can find them all at Just Above The Average FPL Podcast (jatafpl.carrd.co) 
Support the show
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
