    <item>
      <title>GW9 - I Kai'nt Believe I Didn't Captain Salah / Fantasy Premier League 2021/22 / FPL</title>
      <description>Join us as we discuss Fantasy Premier League (FPL) GW9 after what can only be described as one of the most divisive weeks we've had as managers.Some captained Kai, some captained Vardy, the majority captained Salah. We did not expect such a large swing and it hurt those who didn't go with the Egyptian King.We cover the mental side of it, what to do next, how we (CY) felt about the decision making and the outcome etc. Is captaincy relevant in the sense that at this point if it was taken away, would it make a difference? We discuss that too.As always we discuss the games one by one to give our view on what happened and what we can take for the upcoming fixtures.Thanks again to all our new listeners, hopefully we give you some entertainment and we can keep getting you back to the pod in the future. Look out for us as we appear on Twitter Spaces throughout the week, look forward to chatting with you all there soon!Remember that it's good to talk, our DM's are open and we'll jump in as many spaces as possible this week.====================================================================Hope you enjoy the podcast whether you are a new listener or a returning listener, if you haven't yet subscribed please do so.Good luck for GW9!All our podcasts are on Apple and Spotify, you can find them all at Just Above The Average FPL Podcast (jatafpl.carrd.co) Finally - come and join our mini league - the code is 75yytg - see you there!!!
Support the show
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
