      <itunes:season>2</itunes:season>
      <itunes:episode>15</itunes:episode>
      <itunes:author>Above Average FPL</itunes:author>
      <itunes:subtitle/>
      <itunes:summary>YouTube nightmare, but the pod is out!Join us as we discuss Fantasy Premier League (FPL) GW8 with FFScout Hall of Famer Tom Stephenson (currently ranked 2nd HoF).As a Colchester United fan the lack of bias is clearly correlated with his performance season after season and as such we delved in to the games and almost forgot to come up for air at the end. It's our longest pod to date!Thanks again to all our new listeners, hopefully we give you some entertainment and we can keep getting you back to the pod in the future. Look out for us as we appear on Twitter Spaces throughout the week, look forward to chatting with you all there soon!Rough time stamps (but you wouldn’t want to skip surely 😂)Intro and Meet Tom7mins Our weeks 15mins Wat v Liv23mins Bre v Che32mins Salah v Lukaku 41mins Lei v Man Utd55mins Wolves v Villa1hr 1 City v Bur1hr 9 Nor v BHA1hr 16 Armstrong and Broja1hr 22 Antonio1hr 26 Son and KaneLast 10 Questions to Tom====================================================================Hope you enjoy the podcast whether you are a new listener or a returning listener, if you haven't yet subscribed please do so.Good luck for GW9!All our podcasts are on Apple and Spotify, you can find them all at Just Above The Average FPL Podcast (jatafpl.carrd.co) Finally - come and join our mini league - the code is 75yytg - see you there!!!
