      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>YouTube nightmare, but the pod is out!<br><br>Join us as we discuss Fantasy Premier League (FPL) GW8 with FFScout Hall of Famer Tom Stephenson (currently ranked 2nd HoF).<br><br>As a Colchester United fan the lack of bias is clearly correlated with his performance season after season and as such we delved in to the games and almost forgot to come up for air at the end. It's our longest pod to date!<br><br>Thanks again to all our new listeners, hopefully we give you some entertainment and we can keep getting you back to the pod in the future. Look out for us as we appear on Twitter Spaces throughout the week, look forward to chatting with you all there soon!<br><br>Rough time stamps (but you wouldn’t want to skip surely 😂)<br><br>Intro and Meet Tom<br>7mins Our weeks <br>15mins Wat v Liv<br>23mins Bre v Che<br>32mins Salah v Lukaku <br>41mins Lei v Man Utd<br>55mins Wolves v Villa<br>1hr 1 City v Bur<br>1hr 9 Nor v BHA<br>1hr 16 Armstrong and Broja<br>1hr 22 Antonio<br>1hr 26 Son and Kane<br>Last 10 Questions to Tom<br><br>====================================================================<br><br>Hope you enjoy the podcast whether you are a new listener or a returning listener, if you haven't yet subscribed please do so.<br><br>Good luck for GW9!<br><br>All our podcasts are on Apple and Spotify, you can find them all at <a href="https://jatafpl.carrd.co/">Just Above The Average FPL Podcast (jatafpl.carrd.co)</a> <br><br>Finally - come and join our mini league - the code is 75yytg - see you there!!!</p><a href="https://www.patreon.com/aboveaveragefpl">Support the show</a><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
