    <item>
      <title>GW7 - Wildcard Played - Wildcard Active</title>
      <description>32 points the average. Thirty two. THIRTY TWO.So Chelsea clean sheet wiped out, Lukaku with no returns, Ronaldo on the bench. Salah being Salah.It was an eventful week even if the scores perhaps did not reflect it.We take a look at the gameweek in review, it appears the wildcarders did not get back to back victories this week bar a few punts on Chilwell and Azpi, maybe Jimenez (although Hwang stole the show).CY hit wildcard at 10.30am on Saturday for a 2 point gain, Baker is now on Wildcard for the IB. Lots to talk about there.This is where the season really starts, planning for 20+ GW's - bring it on.Thanks again to all our new listeners, hopefully we give you some entertainment and we can keep getting you back to the pod in the future. Look out for us as we appear on Twitter Spaces throughout the week, look forward to chatting with you all there soon!====================================================================Hope you enjoy the podcast whether you are a new listener or a returning listener, if you haven't yet subscribed please do so.Good luck for GW6!All our podcasts are on Apple and Spotify, you can find them all at Just Above The Average FPL Podcast (jatafpl.carrd.co) Finally - come and join our mini league - the code is 75yytg - see you there!!!
Support the show
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
