    <item>
      <title>GW6 - A Red Weekend All Round</title>
      <description>What a rubbish weekend...AJ mud, Golf mud, Spurs mud, FPL just tinkering on mud.The only saving grace was that 4 goals in the NLD meant Macmillan received £20 from us, which can only be a good thing.So, back to the subject at hand. We tried to cover the GW as objectively as possible. Are the early wildcarders now starting to see their fresh tyres yield them an advantage? Usual ramble through the GW and looked ahead to a very difficult set of fixtures this week coming.Thanks to all our new listeners, hopefully we give you some entertainment and we can keep getting you back to the pod in the future.====================================================================Hope you enjoy the podcast whether you are a new listener or a returning listener, if you haven't yet subscribed please do so.Good luck for GW6!All our podcasts are on Apple and Spotify, you can find them all at www.justabovetheaveragefpl.co.ukFinally - come and join our mini league - the code is 75yytg - see you there!!!
Support the show
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
