    <item>
      <title>GW5 - Drama, Drama, Drama</title>
      <description>Trent ill, Son rising from the unknown, Tsimikas, Benrahma injured? All part of the drama that preceded GW5 but we got through with limited damage.We talk primarily about the GW as always, as well as the above with respect to press conferences and when they may not be the most useful.We touch on talismen from lesser/promoted teams and compare them to the rotation risks at the 7m-8m price point in midfield for the premium teams.Close off with some key talking points and a couple of questions from Twitter.Overall RanksCY - 68kBaker - 14kHope you enjoy the podcast whether you are a new listener or a returning listener, if you haven't yet subscribed please do so.Good luck for GW6!All our podcasts are on Apple and Spotify, you can find them all at www.justabovetheaveragefpl.co.ukFinally - come and join our mini league - the code is 75yytg - see you there!!!
Support the show
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
