    <item>
      <title>GW4 - SIUUUUUUUU Many Headaches Going Forward</title>
      <description>SIUUUUUUUUUUHow was your Gameweek? We're still rocking around the top 50k and with a lot of carnage we discuss Ronaldo, Lukaku, Liverpool Baselines, the red card and a good discussion over the gameweek gone by. A few fires now to potentially put out as we put our focus on the next 2 GW's before Wildcard, that's if one of us can hold out that long...Hope you enjoy the podcast whether you are a new listener or a returning listener, if you haven't yet subscribed please do so.Good luck for GW5!All our podcasts are on Apple and Spotify, you can find them all at www.justabovetheaveragefpl.co.uk - website will be updated soon .Finally - come and join our mini league - the code is 75yytg - see you there!!!
Support the show
