    <item>
      <title>The People's Pod v1</title>
      <description>Hope everyone is enjoying the IB, certainly a lot of things happening impacting our decisions for GW4 not least with CR7 being released early after (purposely?) getting booked following becoming the all time leading International Goalscorer despite missing a penalty! WHAT DOES THIS MEAN?!?Anyway. We've mixed it up this week with a People's Podcast inviting three guys for a chat, two of which are relatively new to the community themselves to get some different viewpoints on how they play the game. It's great getting the big accounts on from time to time but we wanted to do something different, and we're glad we did!The usual topics came up re: Wildcard with 2/5 of us basically on it and 3 of us holding firm with transfers in hand. Lukaku, CR7, fixture swings etc. Was a good chat.Thanks to @FPL_Aravind (Aravind), @FPLShark (Garf) and @TFFfan_ryan (Ryan) for joining us. Go give them a follow on Twitter :-)Hope you enjoy the podcast whether you are a new listener or a returning listener, if you haven't yet subscribed please do so.Good luck for GW4!All our podcasts are on Apple and Spotify, you can find them all at www.justabovetheaveragefpl.co.uk - website will be updated soon .Finally - come and join our mini league - the code is 75yytg - see you there!!!
Support the show
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
