    </item>
    <item>
      <title>GW3 - Wildcard Time? RonalDO or RonalDO-NT?</title>
      <description>Gameweek Three is done and we are maintaining rank nicely between us despite having two very different team setups and captains.The main question as we enter the IB....is it time to Wildcard and are we looking at this just for the purpose of getting in the likes of Ronaldo and Lukaku? Do we need to rush in to it or is our team structure at a point where we can observe for a few weeks?Some other takeaways from GW3 and more about GW4 next week when we debut our People's Pod.In terms of the Pod League Jason Schwabe leads the way and takes August Manager of the Month and FPLReuser smashed us in the Predictor (tweet will show that quite clearly), we've got some work to do.Hope you enjoy the podcast whether you are a new listener or a returning listener, if you haven't yet subscribed please do so.All our podcasts are on Apple and Spotify, you can find them all at www.justabovetheaveragefpl.co.uk - website will be updated soon .Finally - come and join our mini league - the code is 75yytg - see you there!!!
Support the show
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
