      <description>Gameweek Two is done and we are flying high...despite both having a captain blank.Few thoughts for this week include:-- Lukaku, when do we move?- Do we need to make considerable changes and what would a wildcard look like?Plenty of other stuff that you'll just have to listen to in order to find out.Rakesh Divya breaks 200 points and leads the way in the pod league and Toxteth O Grady keeps the FPL Community flag flying high in the predictor winning for the "bad" guys again.Hope you enjoy the podcast whether you are a new listener or a returning listener, if you haven't yet subscribed please do so.All our podcasts are on Apple and Spotify, you can find them all at www.justabovetheaveragefpl.co.uk - website will be updated soon with our teams once GW1 is up and running.Finally - come and join our mini league - the code is 75yytg - see you there!!!
