    <item>
      <title>GW1 - Tons Up All Round</title>
      <description>Gameweek One is in the bank and it was like no other seen before, hundreds everywhere.We go through the week in detail looking at each fixture picking out some potential moves for GW2 and also some that maybe we should just wait and see on.Shoutout to Stuart Beed topping the Podcast Mini League on GW1 with 119pts, shoutout to XCasualFPL for leading the charge in the Premier League Predictor we're running with and thanks to the guys over at Fantasy Football Fix for providing the Elite XI which we are attempting to beat this season.Hope you enjoy the podcast whether you are a new listener or a returning listener, if you haven't yet subscribed please do so.All our podcasts are on Apple and Spotify, you can find them all at www.justabovetheaveragefpl.co.uk - website will be updated soon with our teams once GW1 is up and running.Finally - come and join our mini league - the code is 75yytg - see you there!!!Time stamps! Not that you’d want to skip anything anyway…0-6mins Intro, pod league and predictor7-12mins Our gameweek12-18mins Brentford v Arsenal18-27mins United v Leeds27-30mins Burnley v Brighton30-36mins Chelsea v Palace36-40mins Everton v Soton40-44mins Leicester v Wolves44-48mins Watford v Villa48-53mins Norwich v Liverpool53-59mins Newcastle v West Ham59mins-67mins Spurs v City67mins-80 mins On to GW2
