    <item>
      <title>Final Thoughts with XCasualFPL1</title>
      <description>Welcome back to Just Above The Average FPL Podcast, your weekly off the cuff chat between two mates, basically as if it was down the pub.We had John come back to share with us his first experience of an FPL Twitter pre season and how his thought process had changed a bit from previous seasons. Absorbing as much information as possible to try and get a similar start to last year.CY in full Ranieri mode and Baker basically set, we're almost there L&amp;G, we're almost there.Good luck for GW1 - it all starts now.Hope you enjoy the podcast whether you are a new listener or a returning listener, if you haven't yet subscribed please do so.All our podcasts are on Apple and Spotify, you can find them all at www.justabovetheaveragefpl.co.uk - website will be updated soon with our teams once GW1 is up and running.Finally - come and join our mini league - the code is 75yytg - see you there!!!
Support the show
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
