    <item>
      <title>FPL Corf</title>
      <description>Welcome back to Just Above The Average FPL Podcast, your weekly off the cuff chat between two mates, basically as if it was down the pub.We welcome FPL Corf to the pod this week with his creative mindset and how he applied that to FPL, particularly referencing Maslow's Hierachy of Needs (see tweet).https://twitter.com/CORF_FPL/status/1421095146087763976?s=20Some more interesting discussion on the impact of Referees announcement today, will that give us less penalties? Less offsides? Will less offsides mean more penalties? Who knows...Hope you enjoy the podcast whether you are a new listener or a returning listener, if you haven't yet subscribed please do so.All our podcasts are on Apple and Spotify, you can find them all at www.justabovetheaveragefpl.co.uk - website will be updated soon with our teams.Finally - come and join our mini league - the code is 75yytg - see you there!!!
Support the show
