      <itunes:summary>Welcome back to Just Above The Average FPL Podcast, your weekly off the cuff chat between two mates, basically as if it was down the pub.We dive in to a number of subjects this week looking at home vs away, some Twitter updates (don't be a dick...) and talk about about Algo's and their positives / negatives for individuals and the games.Still plenty of time before the deadline bell rings so whether you're doing your best Claudio Ranieri (tinkerman) or just chilling for a few more days hopefully we've given you a couple of things to think about.Hope you enjoy the podcast whether you are a new listener or a returning listener, if you haven't yet subscribed please do so.All our podcasts are on Apple and Spotify, you can find them all at www.justabovetheaveragefpl.co.uk - website will be updated soon with our teams.Finally - come and join our mini league - the code is 75yytg - see you there!!!
