    <item>
      <title>What We Learned - 20/21 Season</title>
      <description>It's all over.Our debut season as content creators for FPL has come to an end and we talk about how it's affected our choices throughout the season.Also a few interesting stats at each position, some referee stuff (Baker loves it), end of season for vs fast starters and captaincy chat.All in all a mix of what we've learned, and what we are looking towards when the new season comes.As always, just a really good chat between two mates who love FPL.H2HBaker 19-18-1 CY ORBaker 28k - 470k CY Thanks for listening and please subscribe.Hit us up on Twitter @aboveaveragefpl/@bakerfpl343 and please leave a review for the podcast (5 stars preferable...not mandatory)In your review chuck your favourite FPL moment and we'll read a few out (if we get any..)
Support the show
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
