    <item>
      <title>Home Straight</title>
      <description>And just like that - 40 podcasts later we are finally there.Quick chat about GW38, some interesting stats and basically revealing our teams for the final week.Check out the website www.justabovetheaveragefpl.co.uk and we will be looking to add more content as we go.A short break of 10-14 days and then we'll be heading over to FanTeam to get our fix of summer Fantasy Football starting with the Euros and also looking at how we can learn the system and attack the big prizes from next year. We'll do a podcast in due course on that. But for now, as Baker says "win those mini leagues boys (and girls)".Good luck for the last one!Latest H2HBaker 19-17-1 CY - Game OverORBaker 29k - 541k CY Thanks for listening and please subscribe.Hit us up on Twitter @aboveaveragefpl/@bakerfpl343 and please leave a review for the podcast (5 stars preferable...not mandatory)In your review chuck your favourite FPL moment and we'll read a few out (if we get any..)
