    <item>
      <title>Preparing for the Home Stretch</title>
      <description>We reflect on a week off and look at how we are going to attack the home stretch.Plenty of good discussion with focus on the next few GW's given that 34 onwards is still mostly unknown.CY is out of chips so navigating the next few weeks carefully to get the most out of the run in. Baker on a one week punt before the Wildcard comes out.Shoutout to everyone again for listening. 2700 downloads! Amazing stuff. We appreciate you all.Good luck for next week guys!Latest H2HBaker 15-14 CYORBaker 75k - 594k CYThanks for listening and please subscribe.Hit us up on Twitter @aboveaveragefpl/@bakerfpl343 and please leave a review for the podcast (5 stars preferable...not mandatory)In your review chuck your favourite FPL moment and we'll read a few out (if we get any..)
Support the show
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
