    <item>
      <title>FPL Merch Returns - BGW</title>
      <description>Low scores all round on the pod this week but it was great to get Ross (@FPLMerch) back on to get his views on GW29.Took a deep dive in to the fixtures this week coming and how to best approach it primarily from a free hit perspective, but also protecting rank through hits (for those mini league masters).Fulham v Leeds - could be open, is Bamford going to play?West Ham v Arsenal - Cresswell a bonus magnet, Arsenal with low headed chances conceded...stalemate?Brighton v Newcas....zzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzz - but CY has Maupay with the armband onVilla v Spurs - Son affecting Spurs counter, all out attack vs Martinez at the back.Please follow @FPLMerch on Twitter and shout outs also go to @fpl_workoutclub (Joe), @ThatFPLLounge (Lama), @FPLBhuna (Bhuna...) and the guys at @FPLPlonker.Good luck for next week guys!Latest H2HCY 14-14 BakerORBaker 142k - 666k CYThanks for listening and please subscribe.Hit us up on Twitter @aboveaveragefpl/@bakerfpl343 and please leave a review for the podcast (5 stars preferable...not mandatory)In your review chuck your favourite FPL moment and we'll read a few out (if we get any..)
Support the show
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
