    <item>
      <title>The One with FPLShark</title>
      <description>We were joined this week by Garth (FPLShark) who is UK born living it up in Canada doing the early shift to keep his rank up high. Garth talks us through his data overload and technical eye test (as a football coach) and how overcoming his bias has rocketed his OR. The man wants to win it, we couldn't find any reasons to go against that. A great chat for sure.In other news... CY was begrudging bad decisions gone by, whether it was Abraham, Maddison or for some reason not having Stones and going with Cancelo/Dias despite the entirety of FPL Twitter going with Stones plus one of those two.A bit more laid back approach but also some good thoughts for the weeks ahead.Is Zaha the prime KDB replacement?Latest H2HCY 11-8 BakerORBaker 182k - 819k CYThanks for listening and please subscribe.Hit us up on Twitter @aboveaveragefpl/@bakerfpl343 and please leave a review for the podcast (5 stars preferable...not mandatory)

Support the show
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
