    <item>
      <title>GW17 Review - Happy New Year!</title>
      <description>Happy New Year to you all. I think we can all agree 2020 will go in to the history books for all the wrong reasons, not least because Liverpool won the league...In all seriousness we're back amongst it after a small hiatus over the festive period, we promised content and didn't deliver (apologies). Just like CY's team over the same timescale.This week we talk primarily BGW / DGW and chip usage as will as discussions over fixture congestion with the Euros coming.Also we cover the GW just gone.Would the FA cancel the FA Cup??!!??Latest H2HCY 10-7 BakerThanks for listening and please subscribe.Hit us up on Twitter @aboveaveragefpl/@bakerfpl343 and please leave a review for the podcast (5 stars preferable...not mandatory)

Support the show
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
