    <item>
      <title>GW11 Review - The Average....was massive!</title>
      <description>This week we cover GW11 and look towards GW12 and the incoming fixture madness and the key talking points are as below:-- Last Man Standing update - down to 8- Our guest Jack strolling in to the top 25k- CY rage transfers and captaincy woes continue with a big red arrow- The Return of Football as Baker headed to Tottenham for the NLD- Rotation risks all round as we head in to 7 games in 21 days- The latest head to head as Baker closes in on CYThanks for listening and whatever you're doing over Christmas please stay safe and enjoy. Remember this is just a game.Hit us up on Twitter @aboveaveragefpl and please leave a review for the podcast (5 stars preferable...not mandatory)
