    <item>
      <title>GW10 Review - COVID Fixture Chaos</title>
      <description>This week we cover GW10 in quite a bit of depth and the key talking points are as below:--CY's captain issues and Baker fires a transfer early-Villa v Newcastle and the repercussions - COVID rotations?-City better with Jesus-Captain Bruno-Tottenham managing games provides a clear ceiling, but maybe not this week.-Offside rule issues, poor Watkins.-Ziyech, the worst player of the weekend.Mini League and Last Man Standing updates.Thanks for listening and thank you for taking us past 100 episode downloads for three consecutive weeks.Hit us up on Twitter @aboveaveragefpl and please leave a review for the podcast (5 stars preferable...not mandatory)
