    <item>
      <title>Attack Of The Casuals - GW8 Preview</title>
      <description>Something a bit different this week as we were joined by three casual friends of ours (in FPL terms) who are all beating us so far this season.Mainly to provide a bit of insight as to how important the eye test is for them and some basic strategies to follow.Apparently this podcast is helping too ;-)Quite a lot of banter, and a few 2-2 draw predicted for next week.Don't forget we have the Last Man Standing competition, please go to our pinned tweet on Twitter @aboveaverageFPL
Support the show
