    <item>
      <title>GW5 - FPL Highs vs Real Fan Lows...</title>
      <description>A real mixed bag watching Tottenham lose a three goal lead in the final 8 minutes only helped by the fact we had Kane and Son between us.Not our most structured effort this week but some good conversation on defensive mindset, albeit not the most exciting part of the FPL game, but could be key to differentiate yourselves from the rest.GW6 is just around the corner, good luck!
Support the show
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
