    <item>
      <title>GW2 madness, @FPL_Lew and Wildcards are active!</title>
      <description>This week we talk with long time FPL Veteran @FPL_Lew as he talks to us about getting the third in the world last year (there’s a pattern here, see episode 3), Leeds, his Triple Captain and his wildcard thoughts.We have a Differential Draft Team assisted by The Algo at Foomni Analytics which smashed GW2.@FoomniAnalytics (on Twitter) have a fantastic platform to help you with your FPL decisions whether short term or medium term and the Algo can suggest transfers, lineups and captains. You can also enter your FPL ID and get a Lite version of this for absolutely nothing. Check them (and our blog) our at FoomniAnalytics.comThanks for listening, drop us a review and good luck for GW3!
Support the show
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
